    exact (GlobalTheory.HTW.Rec.tateDual_matRep_crys (D.loc (D.nd.l i)) (D.nbr i w hw).Kw C.LL _ hF.2.2.1
      (locC_cont' C _ (rTwO_cont D i r hcA x)) (hTw x)).2
  · rw [locC_T2O]
    exact (GlobalTheory.HTW.Rec.tateDual_matRep_crys (D.loc (D.nd.l i)) (D.nbr i w hw).Kw C.LL _ hF.2.2.1
      (locC_cont' C _ hWc) hW).2
