  intro D P HW F CT h5 h12 hIne hT hLOC hRbar hN5g hDZ hG14 hG5 hG6 hTB hBK hBC hLGC hFont htie0 hChi
  obtain ⟨hDJ, hPDR, hPT, hBr, hIE⟩ := GlobalTheory.Closing.closing_at_record D
